{
  "slug": "htmlshop",
  "name": "Htmlshop",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A small local editor for HTML design files. You click stuff, it changes, and it saves back to the file. Made for the workflow of \"I had Claude generate a social post, now I want to tweak the copy and nudge the headline 20px left.\"",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `htmlshop` (Create and visually edit HTML design files such as social posts, carousels, hero graphics, or any 2D layout).\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install htmlshop@claude-community` from `robzilla1738/htmlshop`.",
